opl3.c, opl3.h and LICENSE are unmodified upstream files. NukedOpl3.cpp
compiles the optional upstream stereo extension (OPL_ENABLE_STEREOEXT=1).
The Exult adapter and music driver are GPL-2.0-or-later. No decompiled
original-game implementation or game instrument data is bundled here.

Source distributions must retain these source files, notices, and license.
Binary distributions must retain the license/attribution and provide the
corresponding source and applicable relinking rights under the LGPL/GPL.
The complete Exult source, including this directory and its adapter, is the
corresponding-source basis; publish the matching revision with binaries.
Original game resources remain user-provided runtime inputs.
